<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rom Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Rom Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosh na'o P'awlos wosho Rom ashuwots maants gúút'etso P'awlos Romitse fa'a Ik' moo s'ilosh bí'ettsotse k'ande'er bín bo kotetwok'o woshosha. P'awlos Romitse fa'a amantsuwotston muk' aawosh b́ finiyakon bín bo te'úwe Spen maants amosha b́ tesh, Krstiyani imneti jangosh P'awlos t'iwints b́dek'tsonat krstiyaniwots bo beewotse finats bo jitsitu krstaniwoti danuwots jango ik ikon beezt guut're, P'awlos woshts wosho s'eenon b́datseyir woshanitsne.</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos Romitse fa'a amantsuwotssh b́ jamo b́ t'intsiyakon boosh Ik'o b́ k'onitwok'onowere b́ jangiyihakoon b́ woshman detstso (1:17) «Ik'oke daatsets kááwu woto amanona, amanosha wotiyalo dooshishiyon be'ere» etiru aap'o b́wottsok'owo kitsirwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Haniyere okoon P'awlos asaabiyan gawintsdek'tni b́ guut', ayhudiwotsi wotowa Ik' ash woterawwotsi ash jamwots morrosh keewek bowottsotse Ik'onton maneyo boosh geyife, ashuwots Ik'onton manewosh bofalitwere Iyesus Kerstosn amanaarniye, Ik'onton bo need'iyit ik wot handraan b́dowetwonwere handr be b́wottsok'o P'awlos gawintsdek'tni b́kitsiri. Amantso Ik'oke jeeno detsetwe, Ik'i shayiro morronat k'iri angaatse nas'o keshetuwe, K'ot. 5 tuut 8 P'awlos Ik'i nemonat amantsuwots beyotse finit Ik'i shayiri ango eeg k'alosh b́wottsok'o kitsiruwe, Manats dabt P'awlos «Ik'o ash naarosh b́ gedtsotse ayhudiwotsnat Ik'i ash woterawwots aawuk'oneya ik woto bofaliti?» ett aatetsmansh aanidek'osho etiruwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ando aaniyi P'awlos b́kitstsok'on ayhudiwots Iyesusi dek'o bo k'azonwere Ik'o b́ beezke, manbwotwere Iyesus Krstos weeron Ik'o b́ kitsts kashet deero ash naar jamo b́daatsituwo woshoshe. Wotowa eree ayhudiwots Iyesusi bodek'et dúro b́weetuwok'owo P'awlos amanefe, b́s'uwatsnowere P'awlos krstiyani beyo awuk'o beyo b́geyituwok'o, bítsnor amantsuwots boatsatseyosh bodetsts gonkewon shuni weerats sha'o boosh b́geyituwok'oniye b́ iziri, Ik'osh fini jango, krstiyaniwots bodaatsi jangonat bo atsatseyosh bodetsts jishi keewi jangona, ash asaabiyon tuutson aatet keewwotsnowere ik ikon b́ iziri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Mas'afanitse ááwu wotts asaabiyots kindo 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Kasho ash na'osh geyik b́wottsok'o 1:18—3:20</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik'o b́kashiyi weero 3:21—4:25</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstosn daatset handr beyo 5:1—8:39</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik'o Isra'elsh b́detstso 9:1—11:36</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyaniwotssh fin geyit fino 12:1—15:13</para>
  <para style="io1">S'uwaatsi jamo 15:14—16:27</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Iyesus Krstossh guuts wottso woshosh s'egetsoke, Ik'i doo shishiyo daniyosh marat'etso P'awlosoke wosheets wosho.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Doo shishiyanwere Ik'o nebiyiwots weeron S'ayn mas'aafotse shin shin jangiyets aap'oniye. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Doo shishiyonuwere Ik'i na'o b́ naaron Dawit naarotse b́shuweetsok'o kitsitkee, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Mank'owere no doonz Iyesus Krstos b́ S'ayin shayiron k'irotse b́tuwon Ik' na'a b́wottsok'o bíangi eenon b́daneyi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Krstos shúúts jangosh Ik' ash Woteraw jamwots bo amanituwok'onat boaletwok'o woshosh b́ weeron wosh na'o wotosh noon betsit s'aato dek'rone. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Itwoor Iyesus Krstosk itwotituwok'o Ik'o b́ s'eegts jirwots taalots itne.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Eshe Romitse beyiru, Ik'o iti b́ shuntswotsnat b́jiro it wotituwok'o itn s'eegts jamwotso!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Noo nih Ik'oknat nodoonz Iyesus Krstos s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlo Roomi ams'iilo b́geetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>It imneti shúútso dats jamats b́shishetsotse, jamoniyere shinon Iyesus Krstos weeron it únets jangosh Izar Izeweri údituwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Jam aawo Ik'o tk'onor itn t gawiruwok'o b́ naay jangosh keewiruwo doo shishiyo daniyosh t nib s'eenon bísh t finiruwu Ik'o taash tgaawoniye. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Ando dabr s'uwanatse itok wosh Ik' shuno b́ wotere t weerindo b́káátsituwok'o jam aawo Ik'o t k'oniri. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Imnetiyats it kup'ituwok'o itn woshituwo shayiri imo itsh betsosho, itn bek'osh tewuniruwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Man ti etiruwere taa it imnetiyon, itwere t imnetiyon no atsatsewo nokup'itwok'owe.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Wosh. 19:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Ti eshuwotso! k'osh k'osh Ik' ash woterawwotsitse ay amantsuwotsi tdatstsok'o mank'o ititsnoru shuwo daatsosh geeyatniye tteshi, ernmó itok wosh ay aawo tk'anere andish b́borfetso taash k'ano b́k'aztsok'o it danetwok'o geefe. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Salat'antswotsi wotowa salat'anerawotsi wotowa dantsuwotsi wotowa danawu ashuwotsi daniyo fal k'ayaatse. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Eshe itsh Romn beyiruwotssh doo shishiyo daniyosh tewuniruwe.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doo shishi aap'o Ik'i ango b́woto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar. 8:38</ref> </char>
    </note> Taa doo shishi aap'on jitseratse, doo shishi aap'o shino ayhudiyotssh, bíyats aanat Ik' ash woterawwotssh, Mank'o amants ash jamwotsi kashiyosh falit Ik'i angoniye. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Imb. 2:4</ref> </char></note> Kááwu wotituwo imnetiyon kasho daatsituwe ett guut'ere, Ik'i kááw woto doo shishyon b́be'etsotse b́ jamon asho kááw b́ wotit imnetiyone.<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash na'i gondfino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Ashuwots bogondon aro b́daneerawok'owe bok'aliri, Ik'onowere shato bo k'ztsotse bo gondi jangosh jametsats daaratse Ik' fayo be'etuwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Boon b́ sezituwere Ik' jango dano boosh b́ geyituwok'o Ik'o b́tookon b́kitsre dant boteshtsotsne. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Datso bíazetson tuut ashuwotssh be'erawo Ik'i doyo, manuwere dúre dúri bí angonat Izar Izeweri b́woton bí bíazts keewwots weeron sháánt b́be'eyirwonat t'iwintsosh ashuwots bot'afits t'afiyosh bo etetuwo deshatsne. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:17">Efe. 4:17</ref> </char></note> Bowere Ik'o dant bísh wotit mangonat údon imatsne, bohasabiyon woterawo bowoti t'iwintsraw bonibo t'alu b́wtsi, <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>«Dantsuwots noone» ett dartsuwotsi bowoti. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Iwi. 4:16-18</ref> </char></note> Besherawu Ik'o mangiyoniyere beshit asho aro wotts ariyetso, Kafon, awd tuf detsts gizuwotsn, datsatse geetseyiru dins'otswots aron arit finetsuwotssh mango boími.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Mansh boatsatsewo botook atsats jitsit fino bok'alitwok'o Ik'o kimon s'eents bonib tewunosh keewetswotsi bowotitwok'o k'azb́k'iri. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Man b́wotuwere Ik' aro kooton bowonitsosh, aztso shegro azeetso boik'itsonat bísh guuts bowottsoshe, Ik'onmó dúre dúrosh údeke! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Ashuwots man bok'altsotse Ik'o Woteraw wic'ets tewunosh beshidek't boon bí imi, bo mááts máátsuwots dab azeewon daneets gonkewo daneerawu gonkeyi naaron woni bok'ri. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Mank'o nungushuwotswere daneets gonkewo máátsuwotswotsnton wosho k'azt boatsatsewo bogúsiyon bomis'i, mansh nungushuwots nungushonton jitsits keewo bofini, bo sheeltsi jangosho boosh wotit fayo bomeetson bodek'i.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Ashuwots Ik' dano geyo bok'aztsotse wic'ets keewo bo finituwok'o Ik'o Woteraw nibosh beshidek't imb́k'ri. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Mansha morron, gondon, jaalon, weerigondon, okooron, kashúd'on, shid'eyon, dirshon, gond tewunon s'eent, ando oonetswotsiye, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>Ash shúúts t'afiyruwots, Ik'o shit'iruwots, ash ketiyiruwots, mishetswots, noona boguwotsi etiruwots, gond finosh malo geyiruwots, bonih indosh azazerawwots, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>T'iwintsde'awwots, keewetso gakiruwots, shuno deshawwots, maac'kup'uwotsiye. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>«Keewanotsi k'aliru jamwots k'ire boosh wotiti» etiru Ik'o nemo danfetstniye jaman bok'aliri, k'al mec'ro woterawon, man k'alirwotsnowere bokup'iri.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' angsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk'. 6:37</ref> </char>
    </note> Nee k'osh ashaats angshirwono nee ntokish bíyats nwebitwo deshatsne, k'osh ashaats ni angshor n tookatse niangshiri, nee k'osh ashaats angshfetsat, n angshts ashman b́ k'alirwoniye nk'aliri. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Mank'o k'aliru ashuwotsats, Ik'o boosh wotituwo boosh b́ angshiruwok'o danfone. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Nee ashono! mank'o k'aliru ashuwotsats angishfetsat, bo bok'aliruwo nk'alor Ik' angishi shirotse nkeeshtsok'o neesh arefa? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Himo Ik'o b́ sheeng wotonat jam falk b́woto, noosh b́ k'amonwere bí ankattsono ngac'iri? Ik'o sheeng b́ woto noosh bíayiyi, neen n morrosh naandre eto maants jishosh b́wotok'o danatsneya? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Eshe nee n morrosh naandre eto nk'aztsotsnat maac'o kup' nwottsotse Ik'i fayonat ari angshon b́be'et aawots fayo niats bí ayituwok'owe nk'aliri. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Dub. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Ari. 24:12</ref> </char></note> Ik'o ik ikuwotssh bofinok'oye boosh b́ imeti. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Sheeng finats kup'de'er údonat mangon t'afrawu kashonowere geyiruwotssh Ik'o boosh dúre dúri kasho imetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Botooki keewo geyiruwotsi, ari keewosh azazerawwotsnat gondosh azazeyiru gonduowotsatsomó Ik'i fayonat kaak k'iro boats weetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Shin shino ayhudiwotsats maantsnowere Ik'i ash woterawwotsats gond finiru ash jamwotsats gond bek'onat kic'on weetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Ernmó sheeng keewo kaliru ash jamats Ayhudi wotowa Ik'i ashwoterawwotsi wotowa údono mango jeeno boosh imetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iwi. 10:17</ref> </char></note> Ik'oniye ashuwotsi boga bogshraake.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Nemo bodeshawo morr finiru jamwots nemo bot'ut'alor t'afitúne, nemonowere deshfetsr morr finiru jamwotsmó nemon bo ats angshetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Ik' shinatse kááwu wotituwots nemo shisht finats jitsiruwotsiye bako nemo shisht finats jitsrawotsiyaliye. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Nem deshaw Ik' ash woterawwots bo azeewon nemo bí azaziru keewo kalirune, man weeron nemo bot'ut'aloru botookk wotts azeeyi nemo bodetstsotse k'alosh boon b́geyituwo danfnee. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Bo keewanúwere nemi etiru jam keewo bo nibats b́ guut'ets b́ wotok'o kitsiruwe, aaninuere bonibo boats gawituwe, ikn ikno boon bonibo b́gac'iti, ikn iknonomó boon b́ tep'eti. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Han sháánon b́be'etwere, taa t nabiru doo shishi aap'ok'on Ik'o Iyesus Krstos weeron ashuwots ááshon bofints keewats b́ angshit aawotse.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudiyotsnat bo nemon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Hamb, nee «Ayhudi taane» etirune, nematse nte'eyiri, Ik'k nwottsosho bogtaana etaat ni'it'iri. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Nee Ik' ettso danfnee, Muse nemo ndantsotse sheeng fino danfnee. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>«Nee dogwotsi jishiruwo taane, t'aluwotse faúwotssho sháán taane, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Danawwotssh dano kitsituwe, nanaúwotsno danituwe» níetiri, mank'o, «Muse nemon dano s'eenon detsfe» níetiri, <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>K'oshuwotsi daniruwo nwotor bére ntooko eegishe daniyo nk'azi? úp'mk'ayere nietiri, nemon úmp'e n úmp'iri, <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Wido amk'ayere etirune, nemo wide niamiri, nee Woteraw Ik'uwotsi wic'irune, bo Ik' k'oni moowwotsno fa'o nbiik'iri. <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Nee Ik'i nemwotsne n'it'ri, ernmó b́nemman gakat Ik'o ngac'iri. <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa. 52:5</ref> </char></note> Manuwere, «It ayhudiwotsatse tuutson Ik'i shútso Ik' danawu ashuwotsoke c'ashetwe» ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Gof amo arikon neesh b́ sheenget nemo nkotaale, nemo n gaaketka wotiyalmó gof niamo gofo niamawok'owe b́taaweti. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Mansha gof amaaw Ik' ashwoterawwots jiro nemi tzaziyo b́kotetka wotiyal gofo am b́ k'azo gof bíamtsok'o tawetwoshna? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Nee guut'ets nemo detstsonat gof amtso wotar nemo ngakal b́ meetson gof amawo wotar nemo s'eentsiru Ik' ash woteraw jiro níyats angshituwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Eshe shúúts mec'ron Ayhudi wottso ari ayhudiyaliye, mank'owere úratse be'eyiru meetson gof amo ari gof amaliyee. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Iwi. 30:6</ref> </char></note> Ari Ayhudiwo b́gitsitse Ayhudi wottsoniye, ari gof amonwere Ik'i shayiron S'ayinon wotit nibotse gof amoniye bako nemon guut'etsok'on meetson gof amaliyee. Eshe hannaari asho údo b́dek'et Ik'okna bako ashoknaliye.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ayhudiyots amano bok'aztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Beree ayhudiyots Ik' ashwoterawwotsiyere bok'an eegoneya? Gof amo ayhudiwotssh eebi b́ k'aliti? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Arikon Ayhudi woto ay weeron k'anefe, bog keewo Ik'o aap'o ayhudiyotssh adaro bíimtsoniye. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Eshe Ayhudiyotsitsere ik ikuwots amanek wotar daatseyo bok'azal, bo amanetsuwotsi wotbok'azo Ik'o amanek b́ woto ooritúwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Dub. 51:4</ref> </char></note> B́ jamon oriratse!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">«N aap'ts aap'atse tuutson arikeewetsoniye nwotiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">N mooshorowere angshon da'itune»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:4">Ett guut'etsok'on ash jamo kootetso b́ wotiyalor Ik'o arikeewetske.<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Ernmó no morro Ik' kááwo b́ kitsitka wotiyal eshe eebi no'eteti? Ik'o nomorrosh noon b́seziyal kááwon angshratse eteya b́ wotiti? Hanoke t keewiruwo ashkok'one. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>B́ jamon woteratse! hank'o b́wotitkawotiyal Ik'o datsuwats aak'oneya b́ angshiti?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Ernmó kootetsi twoto Ik'o ar keewutsi b́woto kitsre, b́mangi ayono kitsitk b́ wotiyal, bere taa morretsok'o tiyats angshet eegoshe? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Ik ik ashuwots «Bére, Sheeng keewo b́weyish gond keewo eege nok'aliyala?» etaat tdaniruwok'o woshdek't taan bo s'aamiyir, mansh mank'owwotsats angshet angsho kááwe.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash jamo morretsi b́ wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Bére no ayhudiyots Ik' ash woterawwotsyere k'anefone eteya? Mank'o woteratse! k'osh ash jamo Ayhudi wotowa Ik' ashwoterawwotsi wotowa morretsuwotsi bowottsok'o shin shin kitsre. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Hank'o ett guut'etsok'on,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:10">«Dab ikonúwor kááwu asho aaliye, ik doonzuwor aaliye,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Nibetsonuwere aaliye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Ik'onowere geyiruwo ikdonzwor aaliye.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Dub. 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref> </char>
    </note> Jametsuwotswere weeratse k'az keshrne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Ik wotdek't darwutserne.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Doo fino finiruwo dab ikdoonzuwor aaliye.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Bogogo k'eshets dook'oyiye, bo alberonowere antelcerne, bonoon keewi shuwonwere dawnz marziyok'oyiye<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Dub. 10:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Bonoonuwere c'ashonat s'aamon bín s'eenwtskee.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Botufo ash úd'osh káárke,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Boweeratse daatsetuwere t'afonat dash aanone.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15-17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa. 59:7-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Jeeni weeronowere danatsne,<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Dub. 36:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'onowere b́ jamon sharaatsne.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Dub. 36:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Muse nemi tzaziyo b́ s'iilfo nemmaniyere dashe fa'úwotsi b́wottsok'o danfone, manatse tuutson ashuwots bíyats boweebituwo t'ut't s'k bo etiri, dats jamonuwere Ik'i angshi shirots wotitwe. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Mansha asho konuwor Ik'o shinatse, Muse nemo s'eentson Kasheratse, Nemman b́kitsir ash jamo morretsi b́wotoniye.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kááwu woto b́daatset amanone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Andmó Ik'o ashuwotsi kááwu b́ woshit weero nemalon b́ woteraawok'o be'ere, manuwere Muse nemonat nebiyiwots mas'aafotse gawere. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gel. 2:16</ref> </char></note> Mansha eshe Ik'o b́ k'osh k'oshirawon Iyesus Krstosi amanon amaniru jamosh kááwu woto imetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Ash jamwots morro finernre, Ik'o boosh b́'imts mangonowere t'ut'rnee. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Mansh ashuwots Iyesus Krstos b́ k'alts kashiyi fino Ik'i s'aat mec'ron kááw wotitune. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Ik'o Iyesus Krstosi wosho woshdek't b́ t'ints bín amanitu jamwots b́ s'atson bomorrosh oorowe eto bodatsishee, Ik'o man b́k'al b́k'amoon morr shintso k'azoon ar wotts b́took kááwo kitsoshe. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>And dúranatse Ik'o b́ tookon kááwu b́woto b́kitsir Iyesusi amants jamwotsi kááwu woshoshe.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Haniyak bín noít'et keewo eebi fa'oni? Eegonor id'atsone! bín no id'awok'o woshitwonúwere eebi? Nemo no s'eenirwosheya? Woteratse, ernmó imneti nemone. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Mansh eshe Ik'i asho kááwu b́ woshit, asho nemi fino b́kaltsosh b́woterawo imnetiyon b́wottsok'o t'iwintsdek'etwone. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Himó Izar Izewer ayhudiwots s'uzshe Ik' b́woti? Izar Izewer Ik'i ash woterawwotsshor bokooshna? Arikon Izar Izewer Ik' ash woterawwotsshor boke. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 26:4">Iwi. 26:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gel. 3:20</ref> </char></note> Ik'o ike, ayhudiwotsi wotowa Ik' ash woterawwotsi bo amanere kááwu woshituwo bíne. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Bére, imnetiyatse tuutson nemo gaketuwone eteya? Iya'a, iki nemo kup'ide'erniye nodetsetiye.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Abraham imnetiyon b́kashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Eshe meetson nonih wottso Abraham daatsre noetetuwo eebi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abraham kááwu b́wot finona wotink'ere, bín b́ it'et keewo daatsiyank'e b́teshi, ernmó Ik'i shinatse it'o falratse. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aze. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gel. 3:6</ref> </char></note> S'ayin mas'aafo, «Abarham Ik'on amanere, bíamantsonwere kááwu b́wottsok'o wotatniye bísh b́taaweyi» etfe. <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Finiru asho b́ daatsitwo bí angi k'awnts wottsoni bako bísh imet imoniyaliye. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Asho sheeng fino b́t'ut'alor dab́ morretswotsi Kashitwo Izar Izeweri bíamaniyal bíamantso kááw wotar bísh taawetwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Dawit b́kaaton Ik'o sheeng finalon kááw b́woshit asho awuk'o derek b́wottsok'o b́ kitsor hank'owe bíeti,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Dub. 32:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> «Bo daro boosh oorowe eteetsuwotsnat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Bomorro boosh ipk'reets ashuwots</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Derekne!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Doonzo b́morro bíats b́taawurawu asho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">Deereke!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Bére, Dawit b́keewuts deeran gofdamiyetsuwots s'uzsheya? Himó gof damiyerawwotsshe? Gof daamiyerawtsshowere, «Abraham Ik'o bíamanere bíamantsman bísh kááwu wotat b́taaweyi» etrone.<verse eid="ROM 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Eshe Abrahamsh b́imnetiyo kááwu wotat bísh b́taawe awure? Gofo bíamftse shinemó gofo bíamiyake? Gofo bímfetsere shina bako gofo bíamiyakaliye. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Aze. 17:10</ref> </char></note> Abraham gofo bíamfetsere shino b́imnetiyo kááwu wotat b́datsetsok'o kitsosh milikito bísh b́wotituwok'o gofo bí amiye, hanuwere ando gofo boamaawo amanitu jamwots kááwu wotar botaawetuwok'o boosh niho b́wotishe. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Mank'owere Abraham gof amtsuwotsshor nihe, gof amtsuwotssh niho b́wottsonuwere gof boamtso s'uzosh b́woterawo bí gofo bí amfetsere shino b́detsts imnetiyi shuutso sha'iruwotsshe.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i keewtson amano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Aze. 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gel. 3:29</ref> </char>
    </note> Abrahamnat b́ naaro datsu b́naatetwok'o Ik'o b́ jangiyi imnetiyon b́daatsts kááwona bako nem kotonaliye. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:18">3:18</ref> </char></note> Ik'o b́jangitsman naatetwots nemo s'eentsde'e kotet ashuwotsi wotiyalma imnetiyo k'awuntso deshatse, b́jangtsonwere k'awntsalke. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Nemo b́dowet Ik'i faye, ernmó nemo bíaalink'e morro berawuk'ee.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gel. 3:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Mansh Ik'o b́jangitsman bodaats imnetiyona b́ tesh, Ik' jangitsanwere Abraham naar jamwotssh Ik'oki s'aaton imek b́woto arikee. Manúwere nemo shoydek't sha'iru ashuwots s'uzsh b́woterawo Abrahamkok'o amants jamwotsshe, mank'onowere Abraham noúnetssh nihe <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Aze. 17:5</ref> </char></note> Abraham jangosh, «Ay ashuwots niho neen woshre» ett guut'ere, bí k'irtsuwotsi tuuzituwonat aalo b́ fa'ok'o woshituwo Izar Izeweri bí amantsotsne. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aze. 15:5</ref> </char></note> Abrahamsh n naaro ayider ayituwe ett keewetsok'on ay ashi niho b́wotituwok'o bí amananat b́ jang eegoru jangosh wotit keewo bíalefere. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Aze. 17:17</ref> </char></note> B́ idmewo bal natok'o b́teshtsotse b́ meetso b́maawutsotse k'irts ashok'o b́wottsotse shuwo b́falrawonat Sarawwere mahanat gawertsu b́wottsotse shuwo b́falrawok'o b́danaloru b́ imnetiyon maawk woteratse. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>B́ imnetiyon kup' wotat Ik'osh manga b́ imi bako Ik'o bísh b́ jangitsatse aman k'azoon b́jamon hakebaka eraatse. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Ik'o b́jangitsonowere s'eentsitwo b́wotok'o b́ maac'i s'eenona bíamnefo b́teshi. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Mansha b́ amantso kááw wotat b́ taaweyi. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Ernmó, «Kááwu wotat bísh taawere» ett guut't aap'etso Abraham s'uzsh b́woterawo <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>noshorniye, nodoonz Iyesusi k'irotse tuuztso Izar Izeweri amaniruwotssh nooshor no amantso kááwu wotar b́taaweti. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa. 53:4-5</ref> </char></note> Nodoonz Iyesuswere no morrosha ett k'irosh beshyat b́imeetsonat nonowere kááw woshosh k'irotse tutsoniye.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Imnetiyon daatset jeenonat manon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Eshe no kááw woto nodaats amanon b́ wottsotse no doonz Iyesus Krstosn Ik'onton jeeno detsfone. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>And kup'dek'at nodatseyiru s'aatok nokind bín amanon b́wottsotse Ik'o noosh b́jangits b́ mango kayitwotsi nowottsosh mann it'irwone. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Hanmec'ron b́woterawo gond bek'o k'amo noosh b́daatsitwok'o nodantsotse noo gond bek'on it'iruwone. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>K'amotsnowere fadeyar kup'o, kup'otsnowere jangiyetso daatsetwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Noosh imets S'ayin shayri weeron Ik'i shuno nonibotse b́ s'eentstsotse b́ jangitso noon jitsiratse.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Maawk wotat nobefere Ik'o bíetts aawon Krstos morretswotssha ett b́k'iri. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Kááw ash shegro wotar k'irit asho daatso ayide'er kic'ike, b́woteferor doo ash shegro kirosh daneraka daatso faletuwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Ernmó noo morretswotsi wotat nofa'e noshegro Krstos k'irre, manuwere Ik'o noosh b́detsts shuno awuk'o een b́wottsoniye b́kitsiri. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>No kááwutso Iyesus Krstos s'atsona wotiyal ikibogshr Ik'i fayotse no kashit b́weerone. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Noo Ik'o balangarwotsi wotat nobefere b́naay k'iron Ik'onton no manerone, and Ik'onton nomaneyakon b́ naay kashi weeron iki bogo kashituwone. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Han mec'ronaliye, Ik'onton mano bín nodatstso nodoonz Iyesus Krstos weeron Ik'on ít'irwone.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'iro Adamn, kasho Krstosne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Aze. 3:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik ashaatse tuutson morro datsuwats b́weyi, morratse tuutsonowere k'iro b́weyi, mank'owere ash jamo morro b́fintsotse ash jamats k'iro b́weyi, <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Muse nemo b́ imftsere shin morro datsuwatse fa'e b́teshi, ernmó nemo bíaltsoke morro b́ tookon morrok'o taaweratse b́ teshi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>B́ wotiyaloru Adamkok'o nematse beshat morro finerawotsworu dab bo'orerawo k'iro Adamatse tuut Muse ats b́ borfetso ash jamatse alo b́ daatsi, Adamwere shinomaants weetu Krstossh bí aroniye.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Ernmó Ik'o b́ s'aati imo ash morronton nuutsaliye, ik ash morri jangon aywots bo k'irtsok'o mank'o Ik' s'aatonat ik asho Iyesus Krstos weeron daatsets s'aaton imetso ayuwotssh bogshdek't imere. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Mank'owere Ik'o beenon b́doots imo s'aati oot'o ash iko morro b́doots oot'ok'oyiyaliye. Ash iko morratse tuutson imetso angsho b́doyi, ay morratse tuutson imets imo kááwe wot b́dowi. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Ash iko morratse tuutson k'iro ash jamatse alo b́detsiyakon bére Ik'i ay s'aatonat beenon imetso s'aat bín kashitu ash jamwots Iyesus Krstos weeron kashon naashitune.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Eshe Adam iks'uzo morri fayi angsho ash jamats b́dootsok'o mank'o Krstos ikoko kashi fino ayuwotsi fayotse kishr kasho imetwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Ash iko aleyo b́k'aztsatse tuutson ayuwots morretswotsi bowottsok'o mank'o ash iko bíaletsatse tuutson ayuwots kááwitune. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Morro bíayitsotse nemo b́weyi, ernmó morro bíaytsok'on Ik'i s'aato iki bogsht bíayi. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Man b́wowwere k'iratse tuutson morro b́naashtsok'o mank'o ando aani nodoonz Iyesus Krstos weeron dúre dúri kasho b́ daatseyish Ik'i s'aato kasho imon naashituwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">K'iratse k'aleyok'o morratse galeyar Krstosn beewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Eshe eebi noeteti? Ik' s'aato bí ayituwok'o morrats kup'ar beyonowa? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Woteratse! no k'iron galetsok'o morratse galetswotsi wotefetsr aawk'oneya morratse kup'ar nobeeti? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Krstos Iyesusnton ik wotosh gupets jamwots, b́ k'irono kaytswotsi wotosh, no guupetsok'o danatsteya? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:12">K'ol. 2:12</ref> </char></note> Gupon bínton noduukeyor b́k'ironowere kaytsuwotsi woterone, mansh Krstos Niho mangon k'irotse b́ tuutsok'o noowere handr beyon beetuwone.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>B́ k'iron bínton ik nowottsok'o k'irotse b́tuwon bínton ik wotituwone. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>No ats morretso no atse b́tuwituwok'o morrosh guuts nowoto b́ oritwok'o no ats nato Krstosnton jitetsok'o danfone. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>K'irts asho morrosh kewewotse nas'o keshre. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Eshe Krstosnton nok'iriyakon bínton kashon nobetuwok'o amanituwone, <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Krstos k'irotse b́tuutsi jangosh gitlo b́ k'irawok'onat k'ironuwere bíyatse alo b́deshawok'o danfone. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>K'iroone b́jamon iknoto morrosh k'irre, kashon b́beyonmó Ik'oshe b́beyiri. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Mank'o it k'iron k'alwok'o k'alewon morratse it k'aletsok'o Krstos Iyesus weeron Ik'osh kashon itbeyirwok'o taawwere.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Mansh morro it ats k'iritwatse alo b́detsetwok'onat it meets tewnosh keewetswotsi itn b́woshitwok'o eekk'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Mank'o it atsi kayuwotsi gondosh k'ac'o woshder morrosh kewik'ayere, ernmó k'irotse tuwat kashetswotsi it wottsok'o woshde'er it tooko Ik'osh t'intsuwere, it atsi kay jamwotsi kááwu finosh k'ac'o woshde'er Ik'osh kewiwere. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>And it beyir s'aatoniyere dasha bako nemoniyere dash wot b́k'aztsotse morro itn b́ keewo geyiratse.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kashi finosh guuts woto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Eshe eege no eteti? Nemoniyere dash nowoto b́ oorere s'aatoniyere dash wotar morro finone eteya? B́jamon woteratse! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Bísh alewosh guutswotsi wotosh it tooko bísh it t'iintsiruwosh, bísh it aleyirwosh b́guutsuwotsi it wottsok'o danatsteya? K'irosh morri guutswotsi wee kááwwotosh aleyi guutswots itne. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Itiye shin morrosh guutse it teshi, andmó itsh imets danosh it nibon itazazetsotse Ik'osh údo wotowe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Morrosh guuts wototse nas'o keshat kááawu woti guutswotsi woterte. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Taa hank'o ashosh b́wotit noon keew keewon tkeewir ash azeyon maawuk it wottsatsne. Shin shin it atsi kay kayuwotsi bokiimish weeri gondonat nemalon beyosh guutswotsi woshdek'at it t'intstsok'o andoor itatsi kayuwots bo S'ayinetwok'o kááw wotosh guutswotsi woshde'er t'intswere.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Morrosh guutso itteshor kááwo fino finosh kic'erak itne b́teshi. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Bére, manoor eebi it daatsi? And iti b́ jitsiyiruwoniyere okoon eegor daatsatste, keewhan b́ s'uwo k'ire. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Andmó morri guuts wototse nas'o keshat Ik'o guutsuwotsi itwottsotse S'ayin woto daatsitute, weeronwere b́s'uwatse dúre dúri kashe. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Morrotse daatset k'awuntso k'ire, Ik'oke imet imonmó nodoonz Iyesus Krstosn daatset dúre dúri kashoniye.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Nematse S'ayin woti jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Tieshuwotso! han danatsteya? Tkeewir nemo dants ashuwotsshe, nemo ashaatse alo b́ detset asho kashon b́befetso s'uziye. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Aab s'iilere mááts amts máátsu b́kenih kashon b́befetsosh bínton nemon tipekiye, bkenih b́k'iriyalmó btipets nemotse s'aynat keshraniye. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Mansh bkenih kashon b́befere k'osh kenihosh máátso bi amal widetsuniye bish eteti. Bkenih b́k'iryalmó bínton btipets nemotse nas'o keshetuwane, k'osh kenihosh máátso biamalor widetsuni eteeratse. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Ti eshuwotso! it keewonuwere hank'oyiye, it Krstos atsi kaywotsi it wottsotse k'iron k'alewok'o k'alewon nematse k'alerte, mansh Ik'i finon shuwo noshuwitwok'o k'osho k'irotse tuutsosh b́ jirwotsi woterte. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Meets shunon ananat noteshor nemon tuwiru morri tewuno k'irosh shuwo noshuwish noatsi kayutsitse finefe b́teshi. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Andmó noon tipdek' teshts nemo k'iron galetsok'o no'atse b́ galetsotse nemi tipotse keshrone, mansh haniyere oki bísh nofinit handr shayiri jishona bako shin guut'etsnat wotts nemi jishonaliye.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kesh. 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Iwi. 5:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe eebi no eteti? Nemo b́tookon morreya? woteratse! ernmó morro eeg b́ wotok'o nodanish woshtso nemoniye. Nemo «Tewunk'aye» eto b́k'azik'e tewuno eeg b́wotok'o danawuk'e b́teshi. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Morro nemoke waats tzaziyon gowo daatsdek't jam naari tewuno ti'atsotse b́tuwitwok'o b́woshi. Nemo bíalink'ermó morro k'irke. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Shinon nemo bí aalor taa kashone tbeefoni, nemi tzaziyo b́ watsok'onmó taa tk'irre morro kasho b́daatsi. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Kashosh imetso nemi tzaziyo tiats k'iro b́doy. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Aze. 3:13</ref> </char></note> Morro nemi tzaziyo weeb woshdk't taan b́ ant'elci, tzaziyanatse tuutsonowere taan b́úd'i.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Mansh nemo S'ayine, tzaziyonuwere S'ayinona, k'ááwonat sheenge. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Bére sheeng wotts keewan tiats k'iro dek'waare eteya? Iya'a! ernmó morro, morr wotar b́be'etuwok'o sheeng keewatse tuutson k'iro tiats dek'b́weyi, mansha morro tzaziyatse tuutson iki bog morretso b́woti.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash bewoots fa'a maak'oro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Nemo shayiri weero b́wottsok'o danfone. Taamó morri guutso wotosh kemeets meetsik taane. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gel. 5:17</ref> </char></note> Taa t k'aliruwo danatse, t shunts keewo k'alo k'azat tshit'ts keewo k'alirwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Eshe taa t k'alir tshunaaw keewoni wotiyal nemo sheeng b́wottsok'o gawituwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>K'alo tgeeraw keewo k'aliruwo tiatsotse fa'a morroni bako taanaliye. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Tigitsotse wee tmeets doyotse eegor sheeng keewo k'alosh falaatsetsee. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>K'alosh tgeyiru sheeng keewo k'alratse, ernmó tgeerawu gond keewoniye tk'aliri. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>K'alosh t geerawu gond keewoni tk'aliri wotiyal han k'aliruwo tgitsotse fa'o morroni bako taanaliye etee.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Eshe nemo finats b́jine bek'etuwe, sheeng keewo tgeefere gond keewo tik'altwok'o taan b́woshiri <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Tgitsi atson Ik'i nemon geneúwituwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Wotowa eree nibots nemonton k'efefetst ti'atsotsi kayuwotsitse finiru morri nemosh tipetso taan woshiru k'osho azeewon taan jeep'iruwo ti atsi kayuwotsitse b́ beyok'o bek'iruwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Aawuk'o woteraw ash taane! k'iritu tiatsanowere kone taan kashiti? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstos weeron Ik'osh údo wotowe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Eshe taa tnibotse, Ik'i nemosh keewetso wotat t meets doyon morri nemosh keewetso wotere.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">S'ayn shayiron jisheyar beewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Mansh Iyesus Krstosn beeyruwots and boats angshetuwo deshatsno. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Iyesus Krstosn datsetuwo kash imetu S'ayn shayri nemo, morronat k'ir dowet nemotse nas'o taan kishre. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Ash doyo maawk b́ wottsatse tuutson nemo s'eentsosh b́ falawo Ik'o k'alre, b́took na'onowere morrets meets aron morri jangosh woshat b́ meetson morro angshon ok b́ bazi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Man b́k'aluwere meets shunon b́ woterawo no'atsitsi Shayiri shuntsok'on ananiruwotsats noats nemi tzaziy ariko bí b́s'eentsitwok'owe. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Meets shunon beyiruwotsi meets keewo, Shayiri shunok'on beyiruwotsmó Shayiri keewe bogawiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Meets keewu gawo k'ire b́ doweti, Shayiri gawirúwok'on wotoonmó kashonat jeenone b́imeeti. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Meets keew gawo Ik'oke shit'eek b́wottstse Ik'i nemosh bíalerawotse, kewewono maawre, <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Meets keewosh kéweyirwots Ik'o geneúsho falatsne.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Itmó Ik' S'ayn shayiro ititse beyiruwe wotiyal Shayiri shúnona bako meets shunon beeratste, Krstos Shayiro deshaw ashonúwere Krstos jiraliye. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Krstos itits b́ wotiyal it meetso morri jangon k'irk b́ wotiyaloru Ik'o itn b́ káátstsotse it shayiro beyar beetke. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 K'or. 3:16</ref> </char></note> Iyesusi k'irotse tizts Ik' Shayiro ititse b́beyal, Iyesus Krstosi k'irotse tiztso Izar Izewer it gitsitse beyiru shayiri weeron k'iritk wotts it meetsosh kasho imetuwe.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Eshe t eshuwotso! no kashosh kup'o noosh geyife, ernmó noo beyon meets shunok'on beyo noosh geyiratse. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Meets shunok'on it beyal k'iritute, ernmó S'ayn Shayiri angon it meets fino it úd'iyal kashon beetute. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Ik' Shayiron jisheyru jamwots Ik' nanaúwotsiye. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gel. 4:6</ref> </char></note> Mansh «Niho! no nihono!» etaat it s'eegirwo na'ok'o woti Shayiro it dek'i bako shatoon beyosh aani guuts woti Shayiro de'atste. <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Ik' Shayiro no Shayironton wotar Ik' nanaúwotsi nowottsok'o noosh gawituwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15-17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 4:5-7">4:5-7</ref> </char></note> Eshe Ik' nanaúwotsi nowotiyakon bín naatetuwots noone, Krstosntonuwere naatetuwone, andowere Krstos gond bek'o kaytsuwotsi nowotiyal maniyere okoon b́ mango kayituwotsi wotituwone.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Weet mango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>And gond bek'an shinomaants noosh be'et mangonton b́ taatseyal eegonoru talosh b́ falawok'o woshde tawituwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Azets jamo Ik' nanaúwots be'ewo een tewunone b́kotiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Aze. 3:17-19</ref> </char></note> Azets jamo k'awunts deshawosh kewewtsere, manwere b́ took shunon b́ woterawo jangde'er b́ kotetwok'o woshts Ik' shunone. <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Jangiyetsonwere azeetso b́tookon t'afi guuts wototse nas'o kesht Ik'i nana'úwotsnton s'ayinonat mang kayituwo b́wotituwok'oyiye. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Azets jamó ik wotat hambetsish b́borfetso na'a it'i kic'on detseyat kash k'as'oke b́beyiruwok'o danfone. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 K'or. 5:2-4</ref> </char></note> Ernmó gúútoke fa'o azeetso s'uziyaliye, S'ayin shayir shintso imets dek'tsuwots noworu no atsi shegr wottso Ik'o nana'ok'o woto kotfetsat nogitsitsi atson gúútoke nofa'oni, <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>No noworiye jangiyetsanne. Ernmó no no jangiru keewo be'etka wotiyal jangeet keewo b́woto oorituwe, be'eyiruwonere kone jangiti? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Nobe'aawu keewo nojangiyalmó k'amoon kotetuwone.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Mank'owere awuk'o Ik'o k'ono noon b́geiyitsok'o nodanaawotse S'ayin shayiro nomaawóko noon tep'etuwe, noonon kish keewo falerawo gúúton noosh Ik'o b́k'oniri. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Ash nibo shuu'at s'iliruwo Izar Izewer S'ayin shayiri asaabiyo eeg b́wottsok'o danfee, S'ayin shayiro amantsuwots jangosh Ik'o b́ k'onir Ik'i shuntsok'one.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Ik'o shuntswotsnat b́shuntsok'onowere s'eegets ashuwots Ik'o jam keewo sheengosh boosh b́k'alituwok'o danfone. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Shin b́dantsuwots b́ naayi araar b́ na'onúwere eshu ayuwotsitse k'aab b́wotituwok'o Ik'o shino wotituwe bíettsotsne. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Shino wotitune bíettsuwotsi b́s'eegi, b́s'eegtswotsnowere kááwu b́woshi, kááwu b́ woshtsuwotsnowere b́ mangiyi.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i shuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Eshe keewan jangosh eege noeteti? Ik'o noonton b́wotitka wotiyal kone noon k'efo faliti?<verse eid="ROM 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Ik'o b́ naay ik s'uzosh maac'o b́k'ewerawo noosha ett bíimiyakon b́ naaynton jamkeewo beenon aawuk'oneya noosh ímo b́k'azeti? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Ik'o galb'dek'tsuwotsi kone s'aamituwoni? Boon kááwwotsi woshituwo bíne. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Kone angshituwoni? Bí noshegro k'irre, k'irotse tuut Ik'o niho k'ani aaromants beedek'tso, nooshowere Ik'o k'onirwo Krstos Iyesusiye. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Krstos shunatse noon k'álo falituwo kone? Kic'eemó, gondbek'e? Gishee himó k'ak'e? Himó araats wote, t'up'ertawemó? Shike? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Dub. 44:22</ref> </char></note> Hanwere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">«N jangosh aaw jamó noone úd'eyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Shukeyiru mereerwotskok'o taa weerone»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 8:36">Ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="ROM 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Eshe noon shuntson bín keew jamanotsida'adek'on da'atswotsiyere bogfone. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Mansh k'iro b́wotiyalor, kasho b́wotiyalor, melakiwotsi bowotiyalor, naashuwotsnor bowotiyal, andfa'o b́wotiyalor, shutsi weetuwo b́wotiyalor, kup'uwotsi bowotiyalor <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>Danbaan tuuka wotiyalor, dashaanowere gop'awotiyalor, kon naaro wotowa azeetso wotiyal no doonz Iyesus Krstosn nodaatsts Ik'i shunotse noon k'álosh falituwo eegonwor biaalok'owo arikon dandek'roone.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o Israe'el ashuwotsi b́marat'tsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Krstosn arikoniye t keewiri, kooratse, S'ayn shayiron t nibonúwere tkorawok'o taash gawirwe. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Een shiyanonat k'ut'eraw kic'on t nibotse fa'ee, <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Meetson t jag wotts tjiruwotssha err taa Krstosatse k'aleyar Ik' c'asho tiyats b́bodink'e shunfee b́teshi. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:4">Kesh. 9:4</ref> </char></note> Boye Israe'el ashuwotsiye, na'ok'o wotonat mangi wuliyo nemono b́imi, aron Ik'o bo ik'itywok'ono b́kitsi, b́ jangits keewo bíimi. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Amants nihwotswere bokne, Krstos meetson b́wáá bo naarotsne, bíye jamoniyere dambe. Bíwere dúre dúrosh deeretso Izar Izeweriye. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Wotowa eree Ik' aap'tso wonere etaliye, Israe'el naar jamwots ari Israe'el ashnaliye. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Aze. 21:12</ref> </char></note> Mank'o Abraham naar jamo Abraham nanaúwotsiye etaliye. Ik'o Abrahamsh «N naaro b́ keshetiye Yisak'ne» bíettsoshe, <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Mansh meetson shuwetswots Ik' nanaúwotsiyaliye, ernmó naaro wotar taawetuwots Ik'o Abrahamsh b́jangitsok'on shuwetswots s'uziye. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Aze. 18:10</ref> </char></note> Hanuwere Ik'o b́jangits aap'otse «Hambets naton hank'o aawon weetuwe, Sara nungush na'o shuwitwane» etke b́teshi.<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Man mec'ro b́ woterawo Rbk'aa naruwotssh niho wottsosh Yisak'sh nungush nana'a maatúwotsi b maac'ro, <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Ik'i marat' marat'o finon b́woterawo b́s'eegon b́woto kitsosh git nan'úwots boshuwewonat gondonowere sheengonowere bok'aloniyere shino <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Aze. 25:23</ref> </char></note> Ik'o Rbk'ash «Eenfo múk'efosh keewek wotituwe» bí eti. <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mil. 1:2-3</ref> </char></note> Manúwere «Yak'obi shunre Esawunmó shit're» ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Eshe eege noeteti? Ik'o boga bogshirwe eronowa? B́jamon mank'o woteratse! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kesh. 33:19</ref> </char></note> Ik'oniye Musesh «Bísh doosh tgeyruwosh doowituwe, bísh maac' k'ewo tgeyiruwoshowere maac'o k'ewituwe» etre. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Eshe Ik'i marat'o b́daatset ash shunonat ash finon b́woterawo Ik' dowon b́wottsatsne. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kesh. 9:16</ref> </char></note> Manatse tuutson S'ayin mas'aafotse Gbs' nugúsosh «Neen tiango kitsr tshútsonowere dats jamatse b́daneetuwok'o woshosh neen naashiyire» ett aap'etso guut'ere. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Mansh eshe Ik'o b́shuntsosh maac'o k'ewefe, b́shuntsonowere k'el kúp'etso woshituwe.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Eshe «Ik'i shunts keewo k'efosh konuwor falratse, béré bí ashuwots bo shuntso bo fintsosh eegishe boon b́ b́s'aamiyiri» err taan aato falfete. <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa. 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref> </char></note> Nee ashono! Ik'onton mooshosh eegoneya nfali? Shalon dozets k'ac'o bín dooztsosh «Eegishe hank'o kaldek'at taan ndoozi?» etosh falituwa? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Eshe shal wozirwo iknaari shali tok'ootse k'ac iko mangosh, k'oshonowere ketts finosh woshde wozosh alo deshatsá?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Ik'o b́fayo kitsosho bíangonowere bek'shosh geeyat t'afiyosh k'antsuwotsi fayi k'ac'uwotsi ayoto k'amare wotiyal eendani? <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Han b́ k'aluwere shin mangosh b́k'anitso sheeng b́woto dek'ets k'ac'uwotssh b́mangi ayo kitsoshe. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Sheeng b́ woto dek'ets k'ac'uwotsnmó ayhudiwots mec'rotse b́woterawon Ik'i ash woterawwotsitsnowere noon s'eegree. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos. 2:23</ref> </char></note> Hanwere nebiyiyo Hose'n hank'o eteetsok'one,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">«Tiash teyawuwotsne ‹Tiashuwotsi› err s'eegetuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Shuneerawu ashuwotsnowere ‹Shuneeka› err s'eegetuwe,<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Itiye ‹Tiashuwots itnaaliye› eteets beyokoke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‹Beyat beets Ik'o nanaúwotsi› err boon s'eegetuwe.»<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Isayasuwere Israe'el jangosh hank'o eton b́ k'ááro eenshdek'tine b́keewi, «Isra'el nanaúwots taawo aats k'aritsi shiyok'o dab bíayiyaloru boyitse kashituwots múk'nee. <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27-28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Isa. 10:22-23</ref> </char></note> Doonzo b́ ja'arawo kááronat s'eenon bí angsho imetwe.» <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa. 1:9</ref> </char></note> Mank'owere Isayas «Dari jirwotssh doonzo shooko noosh oriyo b́k'azink'ere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Sedom kituk'o wotiyank'one b́teshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">Gemor kitukok'o wotiyank'one b́teshi»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">ett shin shin keewure.<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Eshe eege no keewiti? Kááwi weero sha'erawu Ik'i ash woterawwots kááw woto bodaatsi, kááwo wotonwere amanar daatsetuwoniye. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Ernmó kááw woto daatsit nemo shuuts sha'at teshts Isra'elots, nemo s'eentsosh bomawutsotse kááwok boratsne. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>«Eegoshe kááwok bodobok'azi?» eteyala bo kááw wottso daatsosh boge amanon b́woterawon finon b́wottsotsne, manshe t'ugwotsn bo k'is'eyi. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Manuwere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">«Hambe! ashuwotsi k'is'iru shútso S'iyonits beezree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Shútsanuwere ashuwotsi k'ic'de'er dikitu s'aloniye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Bín amanituwonmó jiitsratse»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Esra'el ashuwots Ik' weerindon sha'o bok'aztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! t maac'otse beyiru een tewunonat Ik'o maants t t'intsiru k'onon Israe'el ashuwots bokashituwok'owe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Ari danon woto b́ k'aztsosha bako bo Ik'osh okooro bo detstsok'osh taa boosh gawituwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Ik'o ashuwotsi kááw b́ woshit weerindo bodartsotse bo took kááw weerona bosha'i bako Ik' kááw weeron sha'eratsnee. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Ash jamo imnetiyon kááwo b́ wotish nemi s'uwo Krstosiye.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew. 18:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Nem kotón daatset kááw woto Muse b́ guut'tso «Nemo fenats jitsiru jamo kashon beetuwe» etiruwoniye. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Ik'o ashuwotsi imnetiyon kááw b́ woshtsok'onomó hank'o ett guut'ere, «N nibon daro maants kone kesheti?» etk'aye, hanúwere Krstosi orshoshe, <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Wee n nibon «Si'olits kone ot'eti?» etk'aye, hanúwere Krstosi k'irotse tizoshe.<verse eid="ROM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6-8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Iwi. 30:12-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Dabtnu hank'o ett guut'ere, «Ik' aap'tso n ganoke, dab nnononat n maac'otse,» keewanúwere no nokeewiiru imneti aap'oniye.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Iyesus doonz b́wotok'o nnonon ngawiyal, Ik'o k'irotse bín b́tiztsok'o n maac'on niamaniyal kashitune. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Asho b́ maac'on amanar kááwituwe, b́nonon b́ gawiyal kashituwe, <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref> </char></note> S'ayn mas'aafotse guut'etsok'on, «Bín amants jamo jitseratse.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Iyu. 2:32</ref> </char></note> Eshe ikosh doonz wottso jamosho doonz b́wottsosh ayhudiyonat ayhudiy woteraw dagotse eegoru k'osh k'osheyo aaliye, bín k'oniru jamosh b́s'aato ayide'er imetuwe, <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Iyu. 2:32</ref> </char></note> «Doonzo shúúts s'eegiru jamo kashituwe» eteere.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Ernmó bo amaneraniyere aawuk'oneya s'eegosh bofaliti? B́ jango booshiyaniyere aawuk'oneya bo amaniti? Nabirwo alonomó aawuk'oneya shishosh bo faliti? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa. 52:7</ref> </char></note> Nabirwotsi wosheerawonomó aawuk'oneya nabosh bo faliti? Hanuwere, «Doo keewuman shishituwots wáá woo awuk'owe b́geneúshiti!» ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref> </char></note> Ernmó Isayas, «Doonzono! no no aap'tso kone amani» ett b́ keewtsok'o, jamwots doo shishiy keewo de'atsne. <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Eshe imnetiyo b́ daatset k'ebokne, k'ebetuwonúwere Ik'i aap'otsoniye. <verse eid="ROM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Dub. 19:4</ref> </char></note> Aab aatuna, eshe, b́ keewts keewo shiyatsno eteya? S'ayin mas'aafotse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">«Bo k'aro dats jamats b́shiyeyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Bo aap'ts aap'onuwere dats daarats b́ bodi»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:18">ett guut'etsok'on, arikon shishrne. <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Iwi. 32:21</ref> </char></note> Israe'el ashuwots b́ aap'tso danatsno eteya? Han eterawok'o Muse shinon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">«Gac'ets ash ashon okoriyat itn tgoyni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">T'iwitsrawu ash ashon itn tfayi» eteere.<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa. 65:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Isayasuwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">«Taan geerawwotssh tdatseyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">‹Ik'o aawoke?› ett</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Taan aatrawwotssh tbe'eyi,»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:20">ett ááwushúk'on keewure. <verse eid="ROM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa. 65:2</ref> </char></note> Israe'el ashuwotsshomó «Azazerawonat gond ashuwots tmaants boweetwok'o aawu jamo tkishuwotsi t jargi» etre.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o Israe'el ashuwotsi b́jamon juu b́k'aztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Aab́ dab neen aatuna, Ik'o bí ashuwotsi juuwera? B́ jamon juweratse! taa ttookon Israe'el ash taane, Abraham naaro wotat Bíniyam jirots taane. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Ik'o shini b́ marat'ts ashuwotsi juweratse, S'ayn mas'aafo Eliyas jangosh eeg bíettsok'o gawatsteya? Dab Eliyas Israe'el ashuwotsi Ik' shinatse awuk'o ett b́ s'aamitsok'o danatsteya? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Naash. 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14">14</ref> </char></note> Manoor Eliyas «Doonzono! nebiyiwotsi úd'rne wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezono gaakrne, ts'uziye oori, taano úd'oshe bogeyiri» etre b́ teshi. <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Ernmó Ik'o eega ettniya bísh bíaani? «Ba'ali eteets dozets ik'osh tuk'umalerawo shawat kúm ashuwotsi ttokish ooridek're» etre bísha. <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>And dúranatse b́wotsiyal, s'aaton marat'ere ortsuwots muk' Israe'el ashuwots fa'ane. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Marat'onwere s'aaton b́ wotiyal finonaliye etee, finon b́ wotiyal, s'aato s'aat b́ woto orerere etee.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Eahe b́ k'awuntso eebi b́wotiti? Esra'el ashuwots bogetso datsatsno, marat'etswotsmó bo geyiruwo daatsrne, oortsuwotsmó bo maac'o bokup'i. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Iwi. 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa. 29:10</ref> </char></note> Hanuwere «Ik'o bo nibo b́ dúngiyi, mansh eshe hambetsish b́ borfetso bo ááwo be'atse, boowazonuwere shiyatse» ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Dawitwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">«Bomishi maronu detset kambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">dikit gop'o wotar boon kic'ituwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">bofiniru gond fino botokats boree!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Bo ááwo b́ be'awok'o t'aluwowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">bojik'o gond bek'on jam aawo k'urowe» etre.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Aab́ aani neen aatuna, ayhudiyots bodihi aani boturawok'o wotatniya? Mank'owaliye! ernmó ayhudiyots gondo bo fintsi jangosh Ayhudi woterawwots kasho bodaatsi, han b́wotiye ayhudiyots Ayhudi woterawwotsi bo ookoritwok'o woshoshe. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Ayhudiyots gond fino dats jamosh deero datsire, bodiho Ik' ash woterawotssh deero wotere, Ayhudi jamwots bookashink'ee deero awuk'o aye b́wotiyank'oni!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' ash woterawwots bokashitwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>And nokeewir itsh Ik' ash woterawwotsshe, Ik' ash woterawwotssh wosheetso twottsok'osh t finosh mango taash shiyeetuwe, <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>T meets jag wotts ayhudiwotsi okooriyoshe, mank'onowere daneraka ik ikuwotsi kashiyo falituwe etee. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ik'o boon b́ juwoor datsatsi ash k'oshuwots Ik'onton b́ manetka wotiyal Ik'o boon b́ dek'or eeg b́wotituwok'o arefa? Haniyere k'irotse tuwok'oyi etee!<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Ik naari boot'otse shintsotsi kayo S'ayinka wotiyal boot' jamo S'ayinkee b́ wotiti, mank'o mit iko b́s'ap'o S'ayina wotiyal b́ jabwotswere S'ayine bowotiti. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Worfitsi woyra eteyiru mit jaabo wotts ayhudiyots k'ut'eyar bodihitka wotiyal it boditsi woyiriy mit jaabo wotts Ik' ash woterawwots bo shegro shááto shegrshr weyiri zeyito bítse b́keshiru s'ap'ootse keshiru gaalonat deeron kaytsuwotsi itwotiyakon, b́ jaabwotsats ít'k'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>It Ik' ash woterawotso jaabwotsats ít'k'ayere, it it'alomó it jaab mec'ro it wottsosh s'ap'oni itn kuriti bako it b́ s'ap'o kurirwotsi itwoterawok'o dande'ere.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Ernmó «Jabúwots tishat bodihi, taa bo beyok tikinditwok'o» etaatne b́ teshi. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>It ettso aree, ernmó bo k'ut'at bojuwe amano bok'aztsosh b́ wottsotse itwere k'up'at it ned'iye itamantsoshe, eshe, shata bako hit'o itn geyiratse. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Ik'o azeewon jaab wotts ayhudiyotssh maac'o k'ewo b́ k'aziyakon itsh maac'o k'eweratse. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Eshe Ik' doowonat Ik' shatiyon aab s'iilere, b́ shatiyonu b́kitsir dihitswotsats b́ wotor b́ doo wotonu b́ kitsir itshee, hanowere b́k'alir b́ dowon k'up'ar it betka wotiyalemó b́ doo itsh wotituwe, kup'o itk'azalomó itwere k'ut'eyarniye it dihiti. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Ayhudiyots bo amaniyal yoots bobeyok aanitune, Ik'o yoots bobeyok boon aaniyosh falituwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>It Ik' ash woterawwotsmó azeyon boditsi woyiri miti jaabo wotat teshtsuwots it beyokalo worfotsi woyiri mitats tokeyo it faliyakon hanots bo azeyon worfitsi woyiri miti jaabo wotts ayhudiyotsmó yoots bobeyok aanar tokeyo aawuk'oneya boosh b́ maaweeti!<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' mhretiyo jamosh b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ti eshuwotso! «Danfone» err it'k'ayere itsh tkeewitwo ááshts keewo fa'ee, bíwrer Israe'el ashuwots k'azts woto b́ jamosh b́woterawo Ik' ash Woteraw jamwots s'eenon Ik'ok bowafetsoshe. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Isa. 59:20</ref> </char></note> Eshe hank'on Israe'el asha ash jamwots kashitúne. Mansh hank'o ett guut'ere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">«Kashituwo S'iyonn weetuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Yak'ob naar jamatse gondo wokiituwe,<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Erm. 31:33-34</ref> </char>
    </note> Bomorro boosh t t'afiyor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">bonton tkindit taaro haniye.»<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Israe'el ashuwots doo shishiyosh aap'etso dek'o bok'aztsotse, itjangosh it Ik' ash woterawotssh b́dooyish Ik'osh balangaro bowoti, bomarat'ewonmó nihiwots jangats tuutson Ik'o boon shunknee. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Ik'o noon marat'de'er b́ deero bí imiyakon b́ k'alts keewumansh b́gawtso woniratse. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>It Ik' ash woterawwots shin Ik'osh alerawwotsiye it teshi, andomó ayhudiyots aleyo bok'aztsotse it Ik' maac' k'ewo it datsi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>It maac' k'ewo it daatstsok'on boowere maac' k'ewo bodatsituwok'o boowere and Ik'osh alerawwotsi woterne. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ik'o b́ maac' k'ewo ash jamosh kitsosha ett ash jamwotsi ale k'azon is'k'reroshná.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'osh t'ints údo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa. 55:8</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik' gaalona, dani teleefonat danoonúwere awuk'o eene! bí angsho fal bíats boderake, b́ werindonu danerake.<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ik' hasabiyo danetuwo kone?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Bísh iztsi wotituwonmó kone?<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Iyo. 41:11</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'osh gushituwonat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">b́ gushitsono dek'etuwo kone?»<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 K'or. 8:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Jam keewo b́ daatse bíyokne, jam keewo bíne b́beeti, jam keewo bíshe b́ beeyeti, dúre dúron mango bísh wotowe! Amen!<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'osh finosh awuk'on beyo b́geyituwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Eshe eshuwotso! Ik'o genee'úshitwo, beyar beetwonat S'ayin wosho woshde'er it atso it t'intsitwok'o maarts Ik'o shútson itn k'onirwe. Manowere t'intso itn b́ geyitso ari Ik'osh finet finoniye. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Sheengonat genee'úshitwo kim deshawonowere Ik'o shuntso fadbek'o it falitwok'o it nibi gawirwon handraar, it beyo woneewa bako datsani ark'ayere.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Aaninuwere it ik ikets Ik'o itsh b́imts imnetiyok'on tooko dashan detson asaabore bako it angoniyere danb it tookosh bogotaane err asaabk'ayere ett taash imets s'aaton keewirwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>No ats ikatse ay kayuwots fa'ane, noatsi kay ik ikonuwere k'osh k'osh fino detsfe. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-5</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1 K'or. 12:12</ref> </char></note> Mank'owere noo ayuwotsi wotat nobefere Krstosn ik ats noone, ik atsi kayuwotsi nowottsok'on noatsatsewo desheeknone. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Mansh Ik'o b́ s'aaton noosh b́ ímts k'osh k'osh naari deero finats jiitswone, noosh imetso Ik'o aap'ts keewa wotiyal no amantsok'on Ik' aap'tso keewwone. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Noosh imetso k'oshwotssh fina wotiyal kup'ar finone, noosh imetso daniya wotiyal sheengshde'er daniwone, <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6-8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1 K'or. 12:4-11</ref> </char></note> noosh imetso iza wotiyal izwone, noosh imetso tuwdi dowawotiyal nib s'eenon imone, noosh imetso ashuwotsi k'eeza wotiyal kup'ar k'eezwone, noosh imetso mihretiya wotiyal hanowere gene'on k'aluwone.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Git alber deshaw ari shunewo t'ut'k'ayere, gond keewo shid'ere, sheeng keewi shuutso sha'ore. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>It ats atsewo eshuwwots shunon shunewere, it ats atsewosh mango imosh nohewere, <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>mawuk'ayr, Shayron aat'iruwotsi wotoore, doonzosh keewewere. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Jangiyetson gene'owere, gond bek'o k'amoore, jam aawo Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Amants eshuwotsi bokic'or te'úwere, ibwotsno ibíewre.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat. 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk'. 6:28</ref> </char>
    </note> Itn gishirwotsi deerwere, derwere bako c'ashk'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Geneúwirwotsnton gene'ore, epiruwotsnton efere. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>It ats atseyo ik hasabiyon ikwotar beewere, it tooko danbaan deshr bog taana eto k'ayr<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bog taana et k'ayere: </char><char style="ft">T'owwotsnton ik wotar beewere,, wee gac'ets fino finosh it shúno wotowe. </char></note> t'owwotsnton ik wotar beewere. It tookosh danfone etk'ayere.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Ash jami shinats sheeng wotts keewo k'aluwere bako, ashuwots itats gond keewo bok'aliyal, it aanide'er gondo boosh k'alk'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Itsh b́ faleyal ash jamonton jeenon beyosh it weeron it falitu jamo k'aluwere. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Iwi. 32:35</ref> </char></note> T jirwotso! fayo Ik'osh k'ayere boko it it tookon weero oorshk'ayere, «Weer weershtwonat weer worshi gushono anituwo taane etfe Doozo Ik'oni» ett guut'ere. <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Ari. 25:21-22</ref> </char></note> Mansh weer worshoniyere n balangaro b́k'ak'iyal mazuwe, b́shashuwiyal shashuwo kishwe, hank'o n k'aliyal goyinar b́ jitsituwok'o woshitune. <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Mansh gond keewo sheeng keewon da'úwere boko gond keewon da'ek'ayere.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mengsti naashuwotssh alewo b́geyitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Konuworu naash wottso b́ daatsit Ik' shunon b́ wottssotse and datsk'eziruwots bo naash Ik'on b́ wottsotse ash jamo naashwotssh alewo bísh geyife. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Mansh naashuwotsi k'efitu jamo Ik' aloniye b́k'efiri, aleraw jamonuwere sezi angsheyo b́ tookats dowetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Dats k'eziruwotsi shatet gond finirwotsi bako sheeng finiruwotsiyaliye, naashuwotsi shat k'azo geefneya? Bére sheeng fino finowe, booke údo daatsitune. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Naasho neesh sheengo b́ k'alituwok'o naashiyets Ik' guutsoniye, dats k'eeziruwo shiki gorado bí'ed hank'on woto b́k'aztsotse gond fintso nwotiyal dats k'eeziruwo share, bíwere gond finiruwotsi sezosh Ik' weer wershono kitsr Ik'osh finitune. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Mansh mengst naashuwotssh alewo itsh geyife, it aletwere Ik' fay mec'ro shatoon b́ woterawo it nibo itn b́ gac'ituwosh woto geyituwe.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Ereero it imiru manshe, naashuwots finan finosh botuu Ik'osh finoshe. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat. 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk'. 20:25</ref> </char></note> Eshe danbi naashuwotssh k'alo geyituwu jamo k'aluwere, ereero bísh wotituwosh ereero, t'ilisho bísh wotituwosh t'ilisho imere, shatetwono sharere, mango bísh wotituwosho mango imere.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ats atseyo shunewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Kon k'awuntsonúwor itatse beek'aye, itatse beeyet k'awuntsoniye itats atseyo shúnee mec'r wotowe, ash shunetuwo nemo finats jitsre. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>«Wido amk'aye, úd'́k'aye, úmp'k'aye, k'osh ashk wotts keewu jamo tewunk'aye» etiru tzaziyotsnat k'osh tzazi jamwots, «Asho ntookok'o woshde'er shune» etiru ik tzaziyotse ko'eyat bofa'oni. <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Ash shuniru jamo b́ shuniru ash manats gond keewo k'alatse, mansh ash shuniruwo nem jamo finats jitsre etee.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Eshe tokrotse it tuwit sa'ato and b́bodtsok'o dande'ere, shini noamanortsoniyere bogo and no kashit aawo iki nomaants t'inre. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>T'úwonu beshe b́ beshiri, aawonu t'inree, eshe t'aluwotse fineyiru finon fink'ayone, sháánon bin finet kes'i tahono tahade'one. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Weral míshon, mashon, widonat máátsonat nungushi iko ikats keshon, fayonat okooron b́ woterawo aawu shanon beyiruwu ashuwotskok'o s'ayinon sha'owone. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Eshe Doonzo Iyesus Krstosi tahade'ere bako it meets shuni shashuwo kishosh gawuk'ayre.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ashaats angshk'azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Ititse b́ imnetiyon maawuk wotts asho b́ keewo de'ere bako b́ took asaabiyats moosho tuuzk'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Dab ash iko konnari keewo móósh faliyit imnetiyo detsetwe, b́ imnetiyon kup'eraw ashonmó worfi maay mec'ro meetuwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Mansh jam keew meyiru asho mááraw asho gac'k'aye, máárawonwere meet asho ats angshk'aye, Ik'o bínowere dek're. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Bére, ash k'oshi guutso ats angshiruwan nee kone? Bí b́ need'iyal wee b́ dihiyal b́ doonzo kis'e. Dab Ik'o bín need'iyo b́ falituwotse kup'ar need'ituwe.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Mank'o aawu iko aawu ikoniyere bogo mangfe et gawiruwo beyo falituwe, ando k'oshonu aawu jamwots mango taale bako aawwotsitse bogabogo aaliye ett asaabirwe. Eshe hanan arts keewwotsatse asho ik ikon b́nibots bíamantsok'o woshuwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1-6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:16">K'ol. 2:16</ref> </char></note> Ik aawo k'osh aawoniyere bogshde'er mangiyituwo b́ beyal han b́ k'alirwe doonzo mangosha ettniye, jam naari mishono meyiruwo doonzo mangosha etniye b́meyiri, b́ meyiru mishosh Ik'o údituwe, jam naari mishono marawo doonzo mangosha err maratse, maa b́ k'aztsotsno Ik'o údituwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Noyitsere ikonuworu b́ kashon wotowa b́ k'iron b́tokkaliye. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nobeyalo doonzosha nobeeti, no k'iriyalo doonzosha no k'iriti, eshe nobeyalo, nok'iriyalo doonzok noone, <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Eshe Krstos k'irt k'irotse b́ tuu kashon betuwotsnat k'irtsuwotssh doonz wotoshe. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 K'or. 5:10</ref> </char></note> Bére, nee n eshuwats eegoshe n angshiri? Wee ni eshuwi eegishe n gac'iri? No únets Ik' angshi jori shinats ned'ituwone.<verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa. 45:23</ref> </char>
    </note> Manwere, «Taa kashon betuwo taane etfe Ik'oni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">Ash jamo b́ gurbon tshinatse tuk'umalituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">B́ alberon taa Ik' twottsok'o gawituwe» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Eshe notook tookon no took fini jangosh Ik' shinats t'inr aatetwone.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashosh t'ug wotatse aats kordek'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Eshe iko ikats angshk'aye, ernmó asho b́ eshuwsh weratse kambo wee t'úgo gedk'azosh no atso korde'one. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Ik keewo kiime err asaabiru ashosh keew man kima b́ wotiti bako kon naari keewonworu b́ tookon kim b́ woterawok'o taa doonzo Iyesusn t'iwintsdek' danre. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Nee n meyiru mishi jangon ni eshush t'ugo n wotiyal shúnonaliye nbeyiri, eshe Krstos bísh b́k'irts asho n meyiru mishi jangon b́ t'afitwok'o woshk'aye. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Eshe itoke sheeng keew wotts keewo k'oshuwots bok'efetuwok'o woshk'ayere. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Ik' mengsto S'ayin shayiron datsetsetk kááwe, jeenonat gene'ona bako, móónat úshi keewaliye. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Han jangosh Krstissh guuts wotts asho Ik'o geneúshituwe, ashoknowere údeek wotituwe.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Eshe jeenwoto bín datsetuwonat no ats atseyo bín nokup'it keewon sha'owone. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Mishi jangosh Ik' fino gakk'ayone. Mish jamo s'ayine, ernmó k'osh ashosh t'ug wotitu mish móó dáree. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Eshe ni eshúsh t'úg wotk'azosh meetso maak'azo, Weyinyon dútsets biro úsh k'azo, wee kon naari t'ug wotituwo fino fin k'azo sheenge b́ wotiti. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Eshe imnetiyan itnat Ik' dagots wotowe, err n amants keewo b́k'alor b́ maac'o bín b́gac'erawu asho údekee. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>B́ amaneraniyere meyiru ashonmó b́ k'aliruwo imnetiyatse tuutson wot b́ k'aztsosh bíyats angshetuwe, imnetiyon k'aleraw keewu jamo morre.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ashuwotsi geneúsho b́ geyituwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>No imnetiyon kúp wottswots, mawirwots kuro kurdek'o geyife bako no took mec'ro geneúshitu woto geyiratse, <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>no took tookon k'osh asho b́ imnetiyon b́ kup'ituwok'o bín t'ak'amituwonat geneúshit keewo k'aluwone. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Dub. 69:9</ref> </char></note> Krstos b́ tooko geneúshratse, dab «Ashuwots neen boc'ashts c'asho ti'ats b́ oot'i» etiru S'ayn mas'aafotse eteetso bí ats b́ bodi. <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>S'ayin mas'aafotse nodatsituwots k'amonat kup'on, noosh jángo b́beetuwok'o shin guut'ets jamo dano noosh b́ wotituwok'o guut'ere. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5-6"/>Ik níbon wotde'er ik noonon Ik'o nodoonz Iyesus Krstos nihi, bín it mangitwok'o, k'amikonat angi kúp'iko Ik'o Izar Izewer Krstos Iyesus shunok'on it atsatsewo ik níbetsuwotsi woto itsh ime.<verse eid="ROM 15:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Krstos Ik' mangosh itn b́ dek'tsok'o it jamets iko iko de'e. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Hanowere t keewor Ik'o shints nihuwotssh b́ jangitso b́ wotituwok'onat Ik'o arikeewets b́ wotonwere b́ danetuwok'o Krstos ayhudiyotssh guutso wotere etee. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam. 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Dub. 18:49</ref> </char></note> Krstos ayhudiyots guutso b́ wottso k'osh jango Ik' ash woterawwots Ik'o b́ mhretiyosh bín bo údituwok'owe, hanuwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">«Eshe Ik' ash woterawwots dagotse neen udituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">n shúútsosh dubon údo t'intsituwe»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="ROM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Iwi. 32:43</ref> </char></note> Aaninu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">«It Ik' ash woterawotso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Ik' ashuwotsnton gene'owere!» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Dub. 117:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Aaninuwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">«Ik' ash Woteraw jamwots! doonz údoore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Ash ash jamwotswere údoore!» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa. 11:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Ando Isiyas,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">«Iseyi naarotse shuwetuwo weetuwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Ik' ash woterawwotssho jishituwo wotar tuwituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">boowere bojangtso biyats woshdek'etune» etfe.<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>It jangtso S'ayin shayiri angon eenfere b́ ametuwok'o jangetso Izar Izewer bín it amanetsosh gene'únat jeenon s'eenon itsh ime.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos ááwu shuk'on b́guut'tsi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ti eshuwotso! doo woton s'eentsuwotsi, danon gaaltsuwotsnat it ik iketsuwots k'osho izosh falituwotsi itwottsok'o danre. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Ik ik keewwotsi itsh gawiyosh geeyat woshan Ik'o taash b́ imts s'aatok'on ááwushuk'on itsh guut're. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Deeranuwere taash b́ime Ik'o doo shishi keewo Ik'i ashwoterawwotssh shishiyosh kahniyo wotat Krstos Iyesush finoshe, Mansh Ik' ashwoteraw ashuwotssh S'ayin shayiro S'ayintsonat Ik'onowere gene'úshit wosho wotáár bot'inetuwok'o finiruwone. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Manatse tuutson Krstos Iyesun Ik'osh fino tfaltsotse it'iruwee. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ik'i ash woterawwots bo aletwok'o woshosh Krstos ti aap'onat finatse tuutson b́ fints keewo wotiyalabako k'osho aap'osh aawo shu'atse. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Hank'owere een adits milikit finuwotsn S'ayin shayiri angon Iyerusalemnat b gúúratse tuut Elwarik'oni b́ borfetso Krstos doo shishiyo danire.<verse eid="ROM 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Jam aawu t tewuno k'osh asho b́ agtsats dabr ago b́woterawo Krstos shutso b́ shiyerawu beyok jamok sheeng doo shishiyi keewuman daniye. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa. 52:15</ref> </char></note> Hanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">«Haniyere shinon b́ jangosh eegoru keewerawu ashuwots bek'etune,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">b́ jangosh shiyawwots t'iwitsitunee»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Rom Maants Amoosh B́ Gawutsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Manshowere itmaants twarawok'o ayoto taan baziyeree. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Andomó han gúúratsi fa'a datsuwotsatse t finit beeyokuwots bo beetsotse, hank'o ay dúrosh itn s'ilosh een tewuno tdetstsotse <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Ispen maants t amor man weeron itn s'ilosh gawure. Muk' aawosh itnton gene'útsat tteshiyakon twerindo ttuwosh taan falit tep'o it k'alituwok'o jangere. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Andomó Ik' jirwots tep'et gizo deshde'er Iyerusalem maants ametuwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25-26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 K'or. 16:1-4</ref> </char></note> Hanuwere Mek'odoniyonat Ak'yiyi datsatse fa'a Ik' jirwots Iyerusalemn beyiru tugúretsuwotssh boon tep'et gizo woshosh boshunon bogawutsotsne. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 K'or. 9:11</ref> </char></note> Tep'anowere bo shunon imo boosh geyik b́wottsotsne, Ik' ash woterawots ayhudiyotsnton shayiri deero kayosh b́wotiyal boowere bomeets deeron ayhudiyotsi tep'o boosh geyife. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Eshe ko'iyets gizan Iyerusalem maants de'am boosh t imiyakon it weeron waar Ispen maants t ameti. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Itok twoor Krstos deero s'eenon itsh de'er tweetuwok'o danfee.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Tieshuwotso! t jangosh Ik'o maants k'onon tmaak'oriruwo taash itdabish nodoonz Iyesus Krstosnat S'ayin shayiri shunon iti k'oniruwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Ik'o taash it k'onituwere Yihud datsatsi fa'a amanerawu ashuwots kishotse farr Iyeresalemitse t detsts fiinonuwere Ik'i jirwotsoke dek'eyo b́daatsituwok'owe. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Han b́wotiyakon Ik'o bíetal geneúwon itok waarr itoke kashdek'o shunfee. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Jeeniko Izar Izewer it únetsnton wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Feben Knkriy kitotse Ik' moowosh finiru nomish amanetsu b wottsok'o it dano geefe. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Bi taanat k'osh ay ashuwotsi b tep'iruwotse amants ibuwotsi ibiyo boosh b́ wotituwok'o doonzo shútson de'er bish geyit keewo jamon bin it tep'etuwok'o oona itsh etiruwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Wosh. 18:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus Krstos fino finiruwotsnton ik wottsuwots P'rsk'lnat Ak'ilnsh jamo keewwere, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>boowere t shegro k'iroshoru dab k'andek'kne boteshi, hann boon jam aawosh úditwe, t s'uzi b́ woterawo Ik' ashwoteraw krstani woto maants aants Ik' moowwotsworu it údirune. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Bo moots Ik' k'onosh kakuwets amantsuwotssh jamo t'intsuwere.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Isiyi dats kayatse shini Krstosn amantsonat tshuntso Ep'enet'ossh jamo keewwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Itsh ayidek'at maawutsu Mariyamsh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Taanton tipeyat teshts woshetswotsitsere daneets teshts ayhudiyots jaagúwots Andronik'osnat Yuniyassh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuniyassh: </char><char style="ft">Ik ik branon guut'etswotsitse, «Yuliya» etee boetiri. </char></note> jamo t'intsuwere, boowere taayere shine Krstosi bo amani.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Doonzon tshúntso Amp'ilyat'ossh jamo t'intsuwere, <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Krstos finon noonton ik wottso Úrbanosnat tshúntso Ist'akussh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Krstosk b́ wottsotse fadeyat bíere bísh gawetso Ap'elissh jamo t'intsuwere, Arst'obulos maa ash wottsuwotssh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ayhudiyotse t jago Herodiyonsh jamo t'intsuwere, Narsises maa ashuwotsitse Doonzon amantsuwotssh jamo t'intsuwere.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Doonzosh finon ayidek't maawirwotssh Trufaynnat Trufolsh jamo t'intsuwere. Doonzo finon ayidek'at mááwtsunat Krstosn ayidek'at tshunts Persissh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar. 15:21</ref> </char></note> Doonzosh finon ayidek't danetso Rufossh jamo t'intsuwere, taan b naayikok'o shunfu b́ indshowre jamo t'intswere. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asnkritosnat Flegonsh, Hermesmsh, Patrobasmsh, Hermasmsh, bonton fa'a eshúwotssh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Filologossh, Yulyash, Neryanat b́ mishsh jamo t'intsuwere, hank'o Olumpasnat bínton fa'a amantsuwots jamwotssh jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>S'ayin jobon it atsatseyo jobeyar jamo aatewere. Krstosk wotts Ik' maa jamwots jamo itsh t'intsirune.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ti eshuwotso! it dek'ts dan man k'efituwotsi wotat it dagotse k'aleyon gond bek'o dowet ashuwotsatse it atso korde'ere, boatsere wokoore! <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Hank'o ashuwots botookosha bako Krstosshaliye bo finiri. Bonono shaawshdek' dáshon garaamiwots nibo boant'elciri.<verse eid="ROM 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Doo shishi aap'osh aleets ash it wottso ash jamokere b́ danetsotse geneúk t wotwotiyaloru, sheeng keewosh dantswotsi, gond keewoshomó maac' kúp'uwotsi it wotitwok'o geefe. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Jeeniko Izar Izewer káári Shed'ano it tufi shirots tiitsetwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">No Doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aato itnton wotowe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Wosh. 16:1</ref> </char>
    </note> T finonton ik wottso T'imotiwos jamo itsh t'intsiruwe, eshe ayhudiyotse t jag wotts Luk'iyosnat Iyason Sosip'at'roswere jamo t'intsirune.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Woshhan guut'tso taawe T'ert'iyos Doonzon jamo t'intsituwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Wosh. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 K'or. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 T'im. 4:20</ref> </char>
    </note> Taanat hanokere fa'a jamo Ik' moowwotsi Ibiiruwo Gayiyos jamo t'intsiruwe, kitutsi gizo detsiruwo Erast'os, no eshú K'a'rt'os jamo itsh t'intsiruwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft">Hiye awdl taawan yoots guut'ets S'ayin mas'afwotsitse aali. </char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Údi k'ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Taa tdaniru doo shishi keewan Iyesus Krstos jangosh beshiyeyiru woshonat yootstson aashat teshtso, andomó be'ets ari ááshts keewon Ik'onwere it imnetiyats it ned'ituwok'o iti woshosh falituwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Andomó arikan be'ere, dúre dúrts Ik'o tzaziyon jamwots amanar bo aletwok'o Nebiywots mas'aafi weeron ash jamwots bo danetuwok'o k'alere.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>B́ s'uzn dani teleefo detsts Ik'o Izar Izewersh, Iyesus Krstosn dúre dúron údo wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
